{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Information</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myth Guardians is a pixel-graphic strategy tower defense game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must borrow the power of angels and mythological gods to stop the advancing demon army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary gods appear as towers, and players can create powerful synergistic combinations through placement, reinforcement, and synthesis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend each line with tactical placement and skill usage to repel the demon invasion,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and ultimately face off against the demon bosses of the Seven Deadly Sins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mythical Defense with Pixel Graphics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Gods from various mythologies such as Olympus, angels, Egypt, and Norse mythology appear as towers</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade &amp; Synthesis System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and synthesize towers to evolve into more powerful gods.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergy Strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine mythological themes to create synergies and employ diverse deck strategies.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Battles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense duels with the demon bosses of the Seven Deadly Sins, and in Mission Mode, the Four Heavenly Kings also appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609410?t=1760166466","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609410/40e7398093b4ce056d1d0aa3c06e602286b5fa5b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760166466","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609410/bf67c0a55